"text": "What if you dug 200 meters under the bank that stores $800 billion in gold?",
"start": 0.0,
"end": 4.21
},
{
"voice": "am_liam",
"text": "You start on the sidewalk, right outside the Federal Reserve.",
"start": 4.37,
"end": 7.13
},
{
"voice": "am_liam",
"text": "Soon, it's solid Manhattan rock.",
"start": 7.29,
"end": 9.09
},
{
"voice": "am_liam",
"text": "Then water starts seeping in from the walls.",
"start": 9.24,
"end": 11.37
},
{
"voice": "am_liam",
"text": "The vault sits eighty feet down. That's below sea level.",
"start": 11.52,
"end": 14.2
},
{
"voice": "am_liam",
"text": "You'd need a pump running day and night just to stay dry.",
"start": 14.36,
"end": 16.87
},
{
"voice": "am_liam",
"text": "Then you hit a thick wall of concrete.",
"start": 17.02,
"end": 18.78
},
{
"voice": "am_liam",
"text": "Behind it? Over six thousand tons of gold.",
"start": 18.93,
"end": 21.23
},
{
"voice": "am_liam",
"text": "Behind a door that weighs ninety tons.",
"start": 21.39,
"end": 23.37
},
{
"voice": "am_liam",
"text": "Now picture the alarms going off.",
"start": 23.52,
"end": 25.47
},
{
"voice": "am_liam",
"text": "The Fed even has its own police force.",
"start": 25.62,
"end": 27.64
},
{
"voice": "am_liam",
"text": "Then come the helicopters overhead.",
"start": 27.8,
"end": 29.63
},
{
"voice": "am_liam",
"text": "And then the FBI shows up.",
"start": 29.79,
"end": 31.42
},
{
"voice": "am_liam",
"text": "Federal law says up to twenty years in prison.",
"start": 31.57,
"end": 33.97
},
{
"voice": "am_liam",
"text": "But here's the twist. That gold doesn't even back your money.",
"start": 34.17,
"end": 37.06
},
{
"voice": "am_liam",
"text": "Open your wallet. There's no gold in there.",
"start": 37.21,
"end": 39.28
},
{
"voice": "am_liam",
"text": "Not since nineteen seventy-one, when the U.S. stopped exchanging dollars for gold.",
"start": 39.43,
"end": 43.49
},
{
"voice": "am_liam",
"text": "Today, you just walk up to an ATM.",
"start": 43.64,
"end": 45.69
},
{
"voice": "am_liam",
"text": "The bank approves it, and cash comes out.",
"start": 45.85,
"end": 47.87
},
{
"voice": "am_liam",
"text": "An armored truck keeps that machine full.",
"start": 48.02,
"end": 50.07
},
{
"voice": "am_liam",
"text": "Your balance drops. The gold doesn't move an inch.",
"start": 50.22,
"end": 52.57
},
{
"voice": "am_liam",
"text": "Meanwhile, your digger is stuck, and the police are pulling it out.",
"start": 52.72,
"end": 55.6
},
{
"voice": "am_liam",
"text": "Total haul? Zero gold, and one very muddy shovel.",
"start": 55.76,
"end": 58.4
},
{
"voice": "am_liam",
"text": "So, gold or a bank balance, which would you rather have? Comment one.",
"start": 58.55,
"end": 61.79
}
]
}